++locally implemented/validated in `website-builder/` as of this pass. It
++replaces all prior narrative history in this file. Nothing here is a
++claim of live/integration validation — every test in this suite runs
++against local fakes/mocks; no live Vercel, Telegram, Web3Forms, DNS,
++browser, or model-provider calls have ever been made.
